# NOTE: .terraform.lock.hcl is intentionally NOT ignored - HashiCorp
# recommends committing it so everyone (and CI) resolves the same provider
# version/checksums. Run `terraform init` in each env directory and commit
# the resulting infra/envs/*/.terraform.lock.hcl before submitting.

